/*
 * Hartwick Atelier — ABOUT
 *
 * Aloha's About-page wireframe, 15 September 2026, section by section:
 *
 *   hero       ha-about-hero       two photographs, the title plate
 *   house      ha-statement        THE HOUSE — the centred opener
 *   founder    ha-founder          FOUNDER · ANGELA HARTWICK, two columns and a portrait
 *   principle  ha-principle        THE PRINCIPLE — the dark band
 *   journey    ha-circle-columns   A JOURNEY INTO THE HOUSE — four numbered columns (journey layout)
