 *   work       ha-feature          THE WORK AHEAD — photograph and pill button
 *   register   ha-register         THE REGISTER — the same form as everywhere else
 *
 * ⚠️ PROVISIONAL. Every word is transcribed from the wireframe and none of it
 *    is approved for publication yet; each section shows its notice until it
 *    is switched off. Two sentences in the drawing are cut short and are NOT
 *    completed here — nothing may be invented (CLAUDE.md):
