 *        material" and stops.
 *      · Founder, right column, after "The result is not nostalgia." the
 *        drawing has "It is a working model for how a modern fashion house
 *        can value the source of" and stops.
 *
 * ⚠️ PHOTOGRAPHS. The three pictures are cut from the wireframe drawing itself
 *    and ship inside the theme (assets/ha-about-*.jpg), because the re-edited
 *    originals had not arrived with it. Picking an image in any section
